OL,3,GNEWSAThe baby who gives the Christmas
OL,4,Atractor run a special meaning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe farmer is well-known for starting
OL,7,Fthe popular Christmas Tractor Run,
OL,8,Flaunched during Covid 19 to lift
OL,9,Fspirits for isolated residents and
OL,10,Fraise money for charity, and baby
OL,11,FArthur's experience has given this
OL,12,Fyear's event new meaning.
